      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list shows acyclovir sodium is not listed as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 211 tablets of the 400 mg presentation at 15.5 per day, giving 13.6 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
