    {
      "text": "Corvale General also holds 339 vials of the 500 mg/10 mL injection at 15.4 per day, giving 22 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 502 vials of the 500 mg/10 mL injection at 13 per day, giving 38.5 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale Lakeside holds 101 vials of the 500 mg/10 mL injection at 4.1 per day, giving 24.8 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule ranks Eugia US LLC as the first alternate manufacturer; it is not on FDA's shortage list today and its label names no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D6"]
    },
