      "text": "Check whether the Eugia US LLC supply can be traced to a registered plant and review the OAI inspections at Eugia Pharma Specialities Limited (FEI 3008461619) on 2024-02-02 and 2026-02-06 and the 2024-08-15 Warning Letter.",
